WEBVTT

00:09.940 --> 00:13.990
You make so many different expressions,

00:15.060 --> 00:16.660
it makes my heart race.

00:17.260 --> 00:20.190
Th-That's why it's a problem for me.

00:21.310 --> 00:23.860
But I also think it makes you...

00:24.570 --> 00:26.330
that much cuter.

00:31.620 --> 00:33.480
We actually found them.

00:46.290 --> 00:48.640
What? Is something wrong again?

00:48.640 --> 00:50.940
Ah...

00:50.940 --> 00:55.080
<i>Mona Kawai, seventeen years old. 
Osaka born and bred.</i>

00:55.620 --> 00:58.030
<i>A girl who charms as easily as she breathes.</i>

00:59.270 --> 01:01.630
<i>A girl who, for the first time in her life...</i>

01:01.630 --> 01:02.950
<i>finds herself in love.</i>

01:29.400 --> 01:29.820
<b>m 82 222 l 159 118 327 136 364 231 332 300 146 325</b>

01:29.400 --> 01:29.820
<b>Medaka!</b>

01:30.070 --> 01:30.820
<b>m 255 63 l 290 32 404 38 432 83 404 116 286 114</b>

01:30.070 --> 01:30.820
<b>Why are you
always so mean
to Mona-chan?</b>

01:30.070 --> 01:30.820
<b>m 92 258 l 114 236 171 228 225 239 246 266 236 300 214 317 140 318 88 292</b>

01:30.070 --> 01:30.820
<b>Do your tenets
not tell you to be
nice to people?</b>

02:26.250 --> 02:33.000
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

02:26.250 --> 02:33.000
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

02:45.880 --> 02:46.680
Oh...

02:46.990 --> 02:48.140
There they are.

02:50.740 --> 02:52.190
Let's go join them.

02:57.570 --> 02:58.620
Er...

02:58.620 --> 03:02.620
Huh? Oh, r-right, yeah.

03:07.540 --> 03:09.530
Ahem, ahem.

03:09.530 --> 03:11.250
<i>Something's off.</i>

03:11.630 --> 03:16.250
<i>She's really quiet... 
and even cuter than usual.</i>

03:16.250 --> 03:19.350
<i>Wait, what am I thinking?</i>

03:19.350 --> 03:20.760
<i>Clear mind, clear spirit.</i>

03:20.760 --> 03:23.210
<i>No woman, no cry. Calm and collected...</i>

03:20.800 --> 03:23.720
<b>Calm and collected. No woman, no cry. Clear mind, clear spirit.</b>

03:23.210 --> 03:26.760
<i>Clear mind, clear spirit. No woman, 
no cry. Calm and collected!</i>

03:23.800 --> 03:26.720
<b>Calm and collected. No woman, no cry. Clear mind, clear spirit.</b>

03:28.250 --> 03:31.320
I was so worried!

03:32.390 --> 03:33.930
Never gonna let you go again!

03:33.930 --> 03:36.830
Sorry for getting lost, everyone.

03:36.830 --> 03:38.970
Kuroiwa-kun came to find me.

03:38.970 --> 03:41.950
I'm just glad you're okay.

03:41.950 --> 03:45.910
When we lost touch with Medaka too, 
that was when things got serious.

03:45.910 --> 03:48.220
My phone got wrecked.

03:48.220 --> 03:50.420
How'd you even manage that?

03:50.420 --> 03:52.290
Anyway, I'm glad we managed to meet up.

03:52.290 --> 03:55.040
We should hold hands from now on.

03:55.040 --> 03:56.420
Uh, okay.

03:56.420 --> 03:58.640
Just do as she says and hold hands.

03:58.640 --> 04:03.170
If you'd taken any longer, we woulda run 
a lost child announcement over the PA.

04:03.170 --> 04:04.400
Such a shame.

04:04.400 --> 04:05.800
T-Tomo!

04:09.640 --> 04:12.460
U-Um, you see...

04:12.460 --> 04:13.890
Wh-What?

04:15.020 --> 04:16.270
Good, you're back.

04:18.590 --> 04:22.490
You didn't try anything funny with him 
while you were gone, did you?

04:24.220 --> 04:26.260
Wh-Whatever do you mean?

04:26.260 --> 04:28.810
Tell me everything that happened.

04:28.810 --> 04:29.700
But why?

04:29.980 --> 04:31.280
What're they talking about?

04:31.280 --> 04:32.520
Who knows?

04:33.210 --> 04:35.460
I did <i>not</i> try anything funny.

04:35.460 --> 04:37.530
<i>Yeah, something's off.</i>

04:37.530 --> 04:41.070
<i>Her face is all red, too. Is she okay?</i>

04:41.070 --> 04:44.090
Okay, what's the plan? Are we getting food?

04:44.090 --> 04:46.130
Sounds good. Come on.

04:46.130 --> 04:48.510
H-Hey, uh, sorry.

04:48.510 --> 04:53.390
I'm feeling kinda worn down. Can I just go home?

04:53.390 --> 04:54.180
Huh?

04:54.180 --> 04:55.440
Mona-chan?

04:55.440 --> 04:59.020
O-Of course, you all can go eat.

04:59.020 --> 05:02.770
Hmm... I dunno about sending 
you home all alone, though.

05:02.770 --> 05:05.110
Let's save grabbing food for some other time.

05:05.110 --> 05:09.030
Yeah. We had more than enough fun, 
so let's call it a day.

05:09.560 --> 05:10.410
Sorry.

05:10.410 --> 05:14.000
Don't worry about it. 
You okay with that, Namba-san?

05:14.000 --> 05:18.740
Oh, sure. Thanks for throwin' 
this welcome party for me.

05:18.740 --> 05:20.250
It was hecka fun.

05:20.250 --> 05:23.250
Glad you enjoyed it.

05:23.250 --> 05:24.750
We should hang out again.

05:24.750 --> 05:26.210
Where to next time?

05:26.210 --> 05:27.790
How about the movies?

05:27.790 --> 05:30.110
Sounds good. Let's watch a horror flick.

05:30.110 --> 05:32.260
I think I'd prefer a romance.

05:32.260 --> 05:34.770
Nah, action all the way.

05:34.770 --> 05:37.720
I'll go with whatever Mona-chan wants to see.

05:37.720 --> 05:38.770
Same here.

05:45.860 --> 05:50.450
We got split up by the crowd. Oh, well.

05:50.450 --> 05:52.210
How're ya doin', anyway?

05:52.210 --> 05:55.250
I'm fine. I feel bad for ruining things.

05:55.530 --> 05:59.520
Forget about that. There really 
is somethin' off with you, though.

06:00.250 --> 06:03.040
Somethin' happened with Kuroiwa-kun, right?

06:03.500 --> 06:05.760
Wh-Wh-Why do you ask?

06:05.760 --> 06:10.140
Can't think of any other reason 
for you to be actin' this strange.

06:13.830 --> 06:14.890
What?

06:14.890 --> 06:19.870
W-Wait. Lemme sort it all out in my brain.

06:19.870 --> 06:23.520
You didn't forget this was meant 
to be my welcome party, right?

06:23.650 --> 06:25.730
<b>Welcome Party</b>

06:24.460 --> 06:28.900
And yet here we are, goin' home 
without even gettin' food together.

06:26.860 --> 06:27.860
<b>Food</b>

06:26.860 --> 06:27.860
<b>Food</b>

06:30.150 --> 06:33.160
You just told me to forget about that!

06:33.440 --> 06:39.420
C'mon, you can tell your bestie. 
I was really worried, y'know?

06:47.780 --> 06:52.090
W-Well, he kinda knew a bunch already.

06:52.350 --> 06:57.350
He'd noticed that I was lettin' 
my mask slip, like you said.

07:02.560 --> 07:04.220
But also...

07:05.100 --> 07:08.380
He said all of that made me so much c...

07:09.070 --> 07:09.830
C...?

07:11.660 --> 07:13.540
Cuter, apparently.

07:15.170 --> 07:16.280
Oho?

07:17.020 --> 07:18.510
What else?

07:18.510 --> 07:20.960
I really don't wanna say.

07:20.960 --> 07:24.980
I just know you'll laugh at me, 
goin' all, "Told ya so!"

07:24.980 --> 07:26.460
I won't laugh. I promise.

07:27.730 --> 07:29.970
W-Well, I may or may not...

07:31.480 --> 07:33.240
have fallen for him.

07:36.960 --> 07:38.290
I know.

07:38.290 --> 07:40.480
Look, you <i>are</i> laughin'! You liar!

07:41.560 --> 07:46.700
Nah. I'm smilin' to celebrate 
my bestie's first love.

07:46.700 --> 07:49.170
What's up with that?

07:49.170 --> 07:54.960
You finally realized your feelings, huh? 
I'm truly happy for ya, Mona.

07:56.850 --> 07:59.140
Looks like your temp's goin' up again.

07:59.140 --> 08:02.750
What do you wanna do? 
Ask Kuroiwa-kun to walk ya home?

08:03.040 --> 08:04.640
Shut yer trap!

08:08.350 --> 08:09.660
Tomo!

08:09.660 --> 08:10.640
What's wrong, Mona-chan?!

08:09.840 --> 08:13.550
<b>Episode 12: First Love with Him</b>

08:10.640 --> 08:13.160
Wanna hold hands? Lemme just wipe my sweat off.

08:24.060 --> 08:25.240
Asahi!

08:28.780 --> 08:32.950
Don't you live in the opposite 
direction, Mona-senpai?

08:35.960 --> 08:39.720
If you're not feeling well, you should 
go straight home and get some rest.

08:40.270 --> 08:41.080
Bye.

08:41.080 --> 08:43.160
Wait, Asahi.

08:46.570 --> 08:51.200
I just thought I really should 
do the right thing here.

08:52.030 --> 08:53.130
And what's that?

08:55.050 --> 08:59.510
<i>She'll probably be mad at me for saying this 
after denying it so many times.</i>

08:59.510 --> 09:01.680
I knew you couldn't be trusted!

09:01.680 --> 09:04.810
You were clinging to him yesterday, 
and now you tried to kiss him!

09:04.810 --> 09:09.310
No! I'm just tryin' to make him 
fall for me 'cause he just refuses to!

09:10.420 --> 09:11.440
<i>But...</i>

09:12.910 --> 09:15.150
<i>I still gotta tell her.</i>

09:18.430 --> 09:23.410
I-I, uh... about Medaka...

09:27.290 --> 09:29.290
I fell for him.

09:35.570 --> 09:40.560
S-Sorry about this! I wasn't lying 
or trying to keep it from you!

09:40.560 --> 09:44.400
I meant what I said back then, but now...

09:44.400 --> 09:45.930
Aww, shucks.

09:47.810 --> 09:49.820
I knew this time would come.

09:49.820 --> 09:53.790
It would've been so much easier 
if you'd never realized.

09:54.500 --> 09:58.950
Eh, whatever. All this means 
is that I have to try even harder.

10:00.040 --> 10:02.680
<i>She's not mad? But why?</i>

10:04.120 --> 10:09.690
Did you realize it while you were alone
with him after he came to find you?

10:09.690 --> 10:12.000
Huh? Y-Yeah.

10:12.420 --> 10:16.170
Gah. I shouldn't have given 
you guys all that alone time.

10:16.900 --> 10:22.190
That wasn't the time to let Minami 
talk me into getting a double scoop.

10:22.190 --> 10:23.930
Uh-huh?

10:24.470 --> 10:25.850
What's with the look?

10:27.480 --> 10:30.730
Are you getting all apologetic with me?

10:31.860 --> 10:33.820
Give me a break.

10:33.820 --> 10:36.830
Love isn't first-come-first-serve,

10:36.830 --> 10:41.070
and logic doesn't apply to it. 
I get that, okay?

10:43.330 --> 10:48.620
It was love at first sight for me, 
and for you it just happened today.

10:48.620 --> 10:51.960
So please don't be silly 
and feel bad about it or whatever.

10:55.310 --> 10:57.120
<i>She's so cool.</i>

10:57.950 --> 11:01.180
<i>This is who I'm up against.</i>

11:01.590 --> 11:05.920
<i>But I'm not gonna...</i>

11:07.950 --> 11:09.300
If that's all, see you.

11:19.210 --> 11:20.360
Asahi!

11:28.370 --> 11:30.150
I'm not gonna lose!

11:35.090 --> 11:36.630
Bring it.

11:49.600 --> 11:51.980
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

11:54.610 --> 11:56.980
<b>Medaka Kuroiwa
Is Impervious to My Charms</b>

11:57.020 --> 11:59.610
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

11:57.020 --> 11:59.610
<b>The Next Day</b>

12:02.980 --> 12:06.500
<i>I fell in love, and now I have a fever.</i>

12:08.100 --> 12:11.080
I don't even know who I am anymore.

12:14.530 --> 12:19.190
I'm so weird. This has never happened before.

12:21.070 --> 12:23.730
What do I do from here on?

12:23.730 --> 12:24.970
"From here on"?

12:25.650 --> 12:28.260
What am I supposed to do now?

12:28.260 --> 12:33.000
<i>All this while, I was tryin' to make him 
fall for me as the queen bee.</i>

12:33.000 --> 12:37.160
<i>Wh-What comes next when </i>you<i> fall in love?</i>

12:38.900 --> 12:45.870
I'm so used to being loved that I dunno 
what to do now that <i>I'm</i> the one in love.

12:46.420 --> 12:50.120
What do I want Medaka and me to be?

12:55.150 --> 12:56.460
Wanna hit the school store?

12:56.460 --> 12:58.460
Think there's any yakisoba sandwiches left?

13:05.010 --> 13:06.510
<b></b>Mona

13:08.140 --> 13:11.890
How ya feelin'? Fever gone down yet?

13:12.190 --> 13:14.420
Nah, it's still high.

13:14.420 --> 13:17.000
<i>Wait, didn't your phone break?</i>

13:17.000 --> 13:19.020
Borrowed my little bro's tablet.

13:19.360 --> 13:23.210
It's lunch break now, right? Can we chat?

13:23.210 --> 13:24.400
<i>What's up?</i>

13:24.780 --> 13:27.060
I slept too much, and now I'm wide awake.

13:27.060 --> 13:29.120
Talk to me.

13:29.120 --> 13:32.160
I wonder why you feel 
so lonely when you have a fever.

13:32.460 --> 13:37.670
<i>I bet it's not because you're sick 
but because you can't see Kuroiwa-kun.</i>

13:37.670 --> 13:39.420
What're you talkin' about?!

13:40.740 --> 13:42.390
Hit the nail on the head, I see.

13:44.920 --> 13:46.910
<i>You got it all wrong!</i>

13:52.330 --> 13:54.200
Hold on a sec, Mona.

13:56.230 --> 13:58.730
<i>Lemme give Kuroiwa-kun the phone.</i>

13:58.730 --> 14:00.700
Huh? Medaka?

14:00.700 --> 14:05.240
<i>Think of it as him checkin' on ya. 
Hearin' his voice should perk you up a bit.</i>

14:06.820 --> 14:09.220
H-Hold on a second!

14:09.220 --> 14:12.490
I'm in PJs now, and my hair's all a mess!

14:12.490 --> 14:15.730
<i>Better fix that quick, then.</i>

14:15.730 --> 14:17.500
Wait just a minute!

14:21.700 --> 14:23.160
Wh-What is it?

14:25.000 --> 14:27.150
Here, Kuroiwa-kun.

14:28.580 --> 14:31.480
<i>Wait, Tomo! Not yet!</i>

14:33.100 --> 14:34.760
<i>Sh-She's in pajamas?</i>

14:35.520 --> 14:41.000
<i>Stop trying to burn the sight 
into your eyes, Medaka Kuroiwa!</i>

14:41.500 --> 14:47.530
<i>You're a monk in training. 
Clear mind, clear spirit!</i>

14:48.020 --> 14:50.280
<i>Sorry 'bout that, Mona.</i>

14:50.280 --> 14:52.300
<i>No, this is a disaster!</i>

14:52.300 --> 14:56.220
<i>I don't want Medaka seein' me 
at anythin' other than my cutest!</i>

14:56.220 --> 14:58.910
<i>But good job, me, right?</i>

14:59.160 --> 15:00.540
Not at all!

15:00.540 --> 15:03.020
Clear mind, clear spirit.

15:03.020 --> 15:04.100
Okay, here.

15:05.070 --> 15:06.540
I'm gonna hit the restroom.

15:08.300 --> 15:10.940
You two chat until I get back.

15:10.940 --> 15:11.680
Wait!

15:11.680 --> 15:13.930
<i>Whoa, now.</i>

15:13.930 --> 15:17.600
<i>Yikes... What do I do?</i>

15:18.890 --> 15:21.640
<i>Am I bein' a bother?</i>

15:21.640 --> 15:26.570
<i>C'mon, Tomo, don't drag Medaka into this.</i>

15:26.570 --> 15:29.870
S-Sorry about being a bother.

15:29.870 --> 15:31.870
I'll just hang up.

15:31.870 --> 15:32.700
<i>Huh?</i>

15:33.730 --> 15:35.110
<i>N-No, wait.</i>

15:36.030 --> 15:39.160
<i>You're not being a bother.</i>

15:42.590 --> 15:44.920
<i>How are you feeling?</i>

15:46.140 --> 15:50.400
<i>You seemed out of it yesterday. 
You were acting weird.</i>

15:50.400 --> 15:51.170
Weird?!

15:51.170 --> 15:56.680
<i>No, you're not weird, you're cute—
Wait, that's not it!</i>

15:56.680 --> 16:01.880
<i>Er, I'm just saying I realized 
you weren't feeling, uh...</i>

16:01.880 --> 16:04.440
I-It's okay. I know what you mean.

16:09.660 --> 16:13.070
You have these weird moments too, you know.

16:15.890 --> 16:19.200
Let's chat. I'm wide awake 
'cause I slept too much.

16:19.200 --> 16:20.410
Sure.

16:20.410 --> 16:22.360
<i>How was class?</i>

16:22.360 --> 16:24.830
We got a ton of classic literature homework.

16:24.830 --> 16:28.080
A ton? Then show me your notes tomorrow.

16:28.080 --> 16:30.030
<i>What is this feeling?</i>

16:30.030 --> 16:31.560
<i>I-I can do that.</i>

16:31.560 --> 16:34.220
<i>I'm happy... and embarrassed?</i>

16:34.220 --> 16:35.840
What else?

16:36.110 --> 16:40.350
<i>In math, we worked on a problem that 
that's supposed to be on the exam.</i>

16:40.350 --> 16:45.070
Hey, that's important. 
You better teach me when I'm back.

16:45.070 --> 16:48.360
<i>I just know I'm smiling 
from ear to ear right now.</i>

16:48.360 --> 16:52.560
Sure. Uh, why's the background 
rotating so much?

16:52.560 --> 16:54.540
Are you feeling sick and rolling around?

16:55.030 --> 16:56.290
I'm fine!

16:56.290 --> 16:57.570
<i>I'm so happy...</i>

16:58.010 --> 17:00.830
<i>Talking to Medaka is fun.</i>

17:02.710 --> 17:04.330
Let's chat some more.

17:05.050 --> 17:10.290
<i>If he and I started dating, 
could we do this a lot more?</i>

17:10.290 --> 17:12.050
<i>O-Okay.</i>

17:12.050 --> 17:14.350
It's still lunch break, right?

17:14.350 --> 17:16.430
<i>For another ten minutes.</i>

17:16.920 --> 17:18.280
<i>That sounds nice.</i>

17:19.220 --> 17:22.110
<i>I wanna be much closer to...</i>

17:22.900 --> 17:24.930
What are you doin', Mona?

17:27.360 --> 17:28.940
N-Nothing!

17:28.940 --> 17:31.460
<i>What do you want, Ma?!</i>

17:31.460 --> 17:35.450
<i>What do I want? 
I just heard you mumblin' in here.</i>

17:35.820 --> 17:37.830
<i>Rest up, or you ain't gettin' any better.</i>

17:37.830 --> 17:40.200
<i>S-Sorry.</i>

17:44.830 --> 17:46.970
Go back to sleep.

17:46.970 --> 17:48.420
'Kay.

17:50.670 --> 17:52.700
<i>I-I can see...</i>

17:51.610 --> 17:56.040
<i>She would've made so much fun of me 
if she'd found out I was talkin' to a boy.</i>

17:52.700 --> 17:58.470
<i>I can see... Hey, I can see!</i>

17:57.490 --> 17:58.470
What?

17:58.470 --> 18:03.470
<i>Your p-p-pan...</i>

18:00.760 --> 18:03.470
<b>pa                                                                              pa                                                                              pa                                                                              pa                                                                              pa                                                                              pa</b>

18:10.060 --> 18:11.380
What's wrong?

18:14.320 --> 18:16.820
Clear mind, clear spirit. 
Begone worldly desires.

18:16.820 --> 18:19.070
Calm and collected. No straying from the path.

18:19.070 --> 18:21.160
Clear mind, clear spirit. 
Begone worldly desires.

18:21.160 --> 18:23.010
Calm and collected. No straying from the path.

18:23.010 --> 18:25.040
Clear mind, clear spirit. 
Begone worldly desires.

18:24.210 --> 18:26.080
What happened this time?

18:25.040 --> 18:27.530
Calm and collected. No straying from the path.

18:26.080 --> 18:27.530
Why is he like this?

18:27.530 --> 18:28.330
I am void...

18:30.880 --> 18:33.340
<b>m 0 0 l 100 0 100 100 0 100</b>

18:30.880 --> 18:33.340
<b>The Next Day</b>

18:37.100 --> 18:38.880
Morning, beautiful!

18:41.180 --> 18:45.390
<i>Mona Kawai, back in action and fever-free!</i>

18:46.060 --> 18:47.140
<i>I...</i>

18:47.480 --> 18:49.640
<i>I wanna talk to Medaka more.</i>

18:50.030 --> 18:51.650
<i>I wanna be closer to him.</i>

18:52.610 --> 18:53.650
<i>And then...</i>

18:54.120 --> 18:56.400
<i>We'd go shopping together,</i>

18:56.400 --> 18:58.400
<i>watch movies,</i>

19:01.250 --> 19:04.400
<i>gently hold hands...</i>

19:05.030 --> 19:06.390
<i>and stuff?</i>

19:10.730 --> 19:15.040
<i>W-We'd go on dates... and stuff?</i>

19:15.040 --> 19:20.370
<i>All of that'd make life so much fun.</i>

19:20.370 --> 19:21.930
Okay, I've decided.

19:24.570 --> 19:25.680
I'm going for it.

19:26.120 --> 19:28.180
The goal's to get together with Medaka.

19:28.870 --> 19:30.190
I'm gonna do it!

19:30.750 --> 19:32.440
I'm off!

19:32.440 --> 19:34.160
Have a nice day!

19:36.840 --> 19:38.820
<i>My body feels light.</i>

19:39.650 --> 19:41.320
<i>There's a spring in my chest.</i>

19:41.860 --> 19:43.820
<i>Everything has changed.</i>

19:44.170 --> 19:46.270
<i>The world feels like a brand-new place!</i>

19:47.780 --> 19:48.710
Morning.

19:49.240 --> 19:50.650
Good morning.

19:51.830 --> 19:53.830
Morning, Mona-chan.

19:53.830 --> 19:55.940
Morning, Haruno-san.

19:55.940 --> 19:57.170
Let's go to class together.

19:57.170 --> 19:58.090
Sure.

19:58.090 --> 20:01.090
<i>I'm gonna make Medaka fall for me!</i>

20:02.060 --> 20:04.470
Good morning, Mona-senpai.

20:05.170 --> 20:06.720
Good morning.

20:06.720 --> 20:07.940
Morning.

20:07.940 --> 20:09.120
Morning!

20:09.120 --> 20:10.460
Good morning.

20:10.810 --> 20:12.920
<i>I won't let Asahi beat me!</i>

20:12.920 --> 20:16.430
Someone seems spirited. 
Think something happened?

20:17.570 --> 20:19.480
Tomo! Morning!

20:19.480 --> 20:21.860
Mornin'. You good now?

20:21.860 --> 20:22.800
Yep.

20:22.800 --> 20:24.860
Th-Thanks for yesterday.

20:24.860 --> 20:26.600
No problem.

20:26.600 --> 20:29.130
Mona-chan looks like she's loving life.

20:29.990 --> 20:31.580
Morning!

20:32.000 --> 20:33.650
Morning.

20:33.650 --> 20:34.940
Morning.

20:34.940 --> 20:37.400
Are you okay now, Mona-chan?

20:37.400 --> 20:38.500
Morning.

20:38.770 --> 20:42.200
Sorry for making you worry. I'm fine now.

20:42.200 --> 20:43.620
Good to hear.

20:43.620 --> 20:46.540
I was so worried, I couldn't eat.

20:46.540 --> 20:47.890
Yeah, right, you couldn't!

20:54.710 --> 20:57.340
<i>Keep calm, keep calm.</i>

20:57.340 --> 20:59.450
<i>I'm </i>the<i> Mona Kawai.</i>

21:00.500 --> 21:03.600
<i>And you </i>will<i> be mine, Medaka.</i>

21:03.600 --> 21:04.240
Good—

21:04.950 --> 21:06.040
Morning.

21:07.220 --> 21:08.370
<i>He...</i>

21:08.370 --> 21:11.290
<i>He's so dreamy!</i>

21:12.040 --> 21:15.240
<i>C-Crap! Something's wrong with me!</i>

21:18.490 --> 21:21.170
<i>Crap, it fell near Medaka.</i>

21:26.180 --> 21:27.930
S-Sorry!

21:27.930 --> 21:29.230
Go ahead.

21:37.270 --> 21:38.540
Mona-chan?

21:39.190 --> 21:40.280
I...

21:40.650 --> 21:43.340
I don't feel too good! I'm going home!

21:43.340 --> 21:44.840
M... Mona-chan?!

21:44.840 --> 21:46.240
W-Will you be okay?!

21:59.730 --> 22:04.010
I'm gonna make you my boyfriend, 
no matter what!

22:04.350 --> 22:08.840
Just you wait, Medaka Kuroiwa!
